# 🏛️ Jan Sunwai Video Call Platform — Rajasthan Government
## Mobile-Number-Based Multi-Party Video Calling with Native WhatsApp-Style Ringing

---

## 📌 Executive Summary & User Corrections

> [!IMPORTANT]
> ### The Core Correction
> **Previous plan assumed:** Join links via SMS, meeting codes, and passive in-app notifications.
> 
> **Corrected requirement:**
> 1. **Identity is 100% Mobile-Number-based**: All citizens, employees (subordinates/assigned officials), and higher officers have the app installed and log in using their **Mobile Number** (synced/verified with **Rajasthan Sampark**).
> 2. **Select & Call from Sampark**: The Officer (Higher Authority) selects the **Employee** and the **Citizen** directly by their name and mobile number (fetched from the Sampark grievance record or directory).
> 3. **Rings Suddenly Like WhatsApp**: When the Officer initiates the call:
>    - The **Employee's phone RINGS SUDDENLY** (even if locked / in pocket / app closed) with native ringtone + full-screen caller ID ("District Collector Alok Sharma calling for Jan Sunwai - Grievance #12345").
>    - The **Citizen's phone RINGS SUDDENLY** with native ringtone + full-screen caller ID.
> 4. **All Three Connect & Talk**: Both pick up the call, and all three parties (Officer, Employee, Citizen) are immediately connected in a LiveKit multi-party video hearing to resolve the grievance on the spot.

