## 3. User Roles & Identity Model (Mobile-Number Driven)

Everyone logs in using their **Mobile Number** (verified via OTP), just like WhatsApp.

| Role | Identity & Directory Source | What They See / Do | Calling Privileges |
|------|----------------------------|--------------------|---------------------|
| **Higher Officer** (e.g. Collector, SDM, HoD) | Mobile number registered as Higher Authority in Sampark | Searches/selects grievance or contacts; initiates 3-way or multi-party calls; host controls (mute, record, add participants) | **Can initiate calls** to any employee and citizen |
| **Employee** (e.g. Patwari, JEn, Gram Sevak, BDO) | Mobile number mapped to Government Employee Code in Sampark | Profile shows department & designation; receives incoming calls from higher officers; can answer and testify | Can answer incoming calls; can call citizen if authorized |
| **Citizen** | Mobile number registered on grievance in Sampark | Clean, simple app interface; views grievance status; receives sudden incoming hearing calls; talks to officer & employee | Receives incoming calls; cannot cold-dial collectors |
| **Super Admin** | State IT / NIC Admin | Manages department hierarchies, officer privileges, monitors active calls, views audit trails | System administration |

