## 6. Core API Endpoints

```
=== AUTHENTICATION (MOBILE NUMBER + OTP) ===
POST /api/auth/otp/send            # Send OTP to mobile number
POST /api/auth/otp/verify          # Verify OTP -> Return JWT + user role

=== DEVICE REGISTRATION (FOR RINGING) ===
POST /api/devices/register         # Save FCM VoIP token / iOS PushKit token

=== SAMPARK DIRECTORY INTEGRATION ===
GET  /api/sampark/grievance/:id    # Auto-fetch Citizen & Assigned Employee contact details
GET  /api/sampark/officers/search  # Search other department officers by name/dept/phone

=== CALL DISPATCH & VOIP RINGING ===
POST /api/calls/initiate-group     # Officer dials Citizen + Employee (triggers instant ringing)
POST /api/calls/:id/respond        # Target user Accepts or Declines the call
POST /api/calls/:id/add-officer    # Mid-call: Officer dials additional person by phone
POST /api/calls/:id/end            # Host ends call for all parties
GET  /api/calls/:id/livekit-token  # Get LiveKit room access token on call acceptance

=== RECORDINGS & AUDIT ===
GET  /api/calls/:id/recording      # View MP4 recording of the Jan Sunwai hearing
POST /api/calls/:id/sync-sampark   # Push call summary and recording back to Sampark portal
```

