## 7. Implementation Roadmap

### Phase 1: Core Calling Engine & Sampark Integration (Web & Backend)
- Set up self-hosted LiveKit SFU with Redis and PostgreSQL.
- Implement Mobile OTP Auth with phone-as-primary-key.
- Implement Sampark Grievance API connector (fetch citizen + employee phone numbers).
- Build Officer Web Dashboard with Grievance lookup and "Call Both" trigger.
- Implement Web browser incoming call ringing (WhatsApp Web style).

### Phase 2: React Native Mobile App with Native WhatsApp-Style Ringing
- Implement Android `ConnectionService` / Full-Screen Intent high-priority VoIP push.
- Implement iOS `CallKit` + `PushKit` provider.
- Test sudden incoming call ring on locked Android and iOS devices.
- Connect LiveKit WebRTC video stream immediately upon call acceptance.

### Phase 3: Mid-Call Dialing, Egress Recording & Fallbacks
- Support dialing extra officers by mobile number while call is already live.
- LiveKit Egress pipeline: record multi-party hearing to MP4.
- Automatic sync of video recording link to the Sampark grievance timeline.
- Fallback SMS with direct join link if user has uninstalled the app or has poor network.

### Phase 4: Production Deployment & Scale
- Deploy on Rajasthan State Data Center (SDC) / NIC Indian Cloud infrastructure.
- Load testing for 10,000+ simultaneous hearings across districts.
- Security hardening (CERT-In compliance, end-to-end media encryption).

